      "widgets_values": [
        "# LatentSync 1.6 — re-dub a clip with a new voice\n\nWritten for AIXMAN (not a Comfy-Org template: there is none for video lip-sync).\n\n- **LatentSyncNode** — vinavfx/ComfyUI-LatentSyncWrapper, with its InsightFace detector replaced by face-alignment (BSD-3) on the worker. Renders at 25 fps, as long as the voice; a shorter clip is played back and forth.\n- **AixmanLoadVideo25** — written by the worker's setup script: decodes the clip with ffmpeg at 25 fps, only as many seconds as the voice runs, long side capped. Core LoadVideo would hand over every frame at full size and rate.\n- The saved file carries the customer's own recording (CreateVideo ← the trim), not the node's 16 kHz copy.\n\nWeights: ByteDance/LatentSync-1.6 (`latentsync_unet.pt`, `whisper/tiny.pt`), stabilityai/sd-vae-ft-mse."
      ]
    }
